# Working directory used by code/common/run_notebooks.py
run/

# Model checkpoints. Kept out deliberately: the ResNet50 baseline alone is
# 94.7 MB, at GitHub's 100 MB hard per-file limit, and the four together are
# ~111 MB. They are reproducible by re-running the notebooks -- see
# models/README.md. The label map (a few KB) IS tracked, because the reports
# reference it.
*.pth
*.pt
*.ckpt

# The dataset itself (~580 MB) and any local copy of it
malebin_data/
data/
*.zip

# A stray nested clone of this repository left behind by an earlier session.
